{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39940","headline":"上阳宫词 · 徐夤","name":"上阳宫词","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"点点苔钱上玉墀，日斜空望六龙西。\n妆台尘暗青鸾掩，宫树月明黄鸟啼。\n庭草可怜分雨露，君恩深恨隔云泥。\n银蟾借与金波路，得入重轮伴羿妻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39940.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39940","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}